    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the story of Isur, a Tiir (a creature similar to slimes) who lives in the Dark Forest. When his best friend Valt is captured by humans, Isur must seek the wisdom of the village elder. However, before he can do so, he is intercepted by a mysterious human who grants him a power beyond his understanding. Now, his mission is to find other Tiir scattered across the world to gain the strength and abilities necessary to rescue Valt and bring him to a new sanctuary for their species.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What are the Tiir? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tiir are soft, round, and transparent masses that are very curious about everything around them. Despite their appearance, they are very sturdy and have lived for hundreds of years.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tiir do not require food to survive, but they love to eat anything smaller than themselves. Over time, they can acquire the coloration and properties of the food they consume. Due to their abilities, these creatures are often hunted by humans for potion-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTiir Request is a retro RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tTurn-based combat</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tIn-game achievements</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 15+ places to explore </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tYou will need your skills to make your way and find all the Tiir</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tBe careful with humans; touching one could start a battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tLook for the bright light to save your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warning</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tThis game is only available in Spanish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tThe story of this game is part of the world of Angel Request, the book.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controls:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147350/extras/f06e98de3912b7b86d1eb3a001793cb7.avif?t=1726782382\" width=500 height=208 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3147350/extras/a9886ed436ffc99ead4fbf5845089c88.avif?t=1726782382\" width=500 height=208 /></span></p>",
